{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50847","headline":"白鹤观水阁题诗（题拟） · 郑畋","name":"白鹤观水阁题诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松阴如幄水如罗，秋尽山青白鸟过。\n独坐一庵心正寂，数声何处竹枝歌。\n（见《永乐大典》卷二三四三「六模」「梧」字「梧州府」引《舆地纪胜》云「白鹤观在州西。\n咸通末，郑畋守苍梧，建水阁，题诗」。\n）（此诗见《太平寰宇记》卷一六四、《舆地纪胜》卷一○八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑畋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}